# name: The market cycle
# blurb: Trading: the four phases of a market, round a cycle.
title "The market cycle"
layout cycle
paper napkin
pen marker
steps auto

center "sentiment"
acc: circle "Accumulation"
markup: circle "Mark-up" green
dist: circle "Distribution"
markdown: circle "Mark-down" red
cycle acc, markup, dist, markdown
note acc "smart money buys\nquietly"
note dist "everyone is\nbullish"
